 "body_html": "<h2>How to think about it</h2><div class='qfig'><svg viewBox='0 0 400 125' width='400' height='125' role='img' aria-label='a lever, a ramp, a wheel and a pulley'><polygon points='50,78 40,95 60,95' fill='#c98f00'/><line x1='8' y1='70' x2='92' y2='86' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='5'/><text x='50' y='118' font-size='15' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif' fill='#2b2b2b'>lever</text><g transform='translate(100,0)'><polygon points='10,95 90,95 90,45' fill='#8fbf6f' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='45' y='52' width='18' height='14' fill='#c0504d' transform='rotate(-32 54 59)'/><text x='50' y='118' font-size='15' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif' fill='#2b2b2b'>ramp</text></g><g transform='translate(200,0)'><circle cx='50' cy='65' r='28' fill='none' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='5'/><circle cx='50' cy='65' r='5' fill='#2b2b2b'/><line x1='50' y1='65' x2='50' y2='37' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='50' y1='65' x2='78' y2='65' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='50' y='118' font-size='15' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif' fill='#2b2b2b'>wheel</text></g><g transform='translate(300,0)'><line x1='20' y1='12' x2='80' y2='12' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='4'/><line x1='50' y1='12' x2='50' y2='25' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='3'/><circle cx='50' cy='35' r='11' fill='#dfe3e7' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='3'/><line x1='39' y1='35' x2='39' y2='90' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='61' y1='35' x2='61' y2='80' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='52' y='80' width='18' height='14' fill='#4f81bd'/><text x='50' y='118' font-size='15' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif' fill='#2b2b2b'>pulley</text></g></svg></div><p><b>There are six simple machines.</b></p><ul><li>Lever (seesaw), ramp, wedge (axe), screw (jar lid).</li><li>Wheel and axle (wagon), pulley (flagpole).</li><li>They help us push, pull and lift with less effort.</li></ul><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>Example</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>Which machine is a seesaw?</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>it turns on a middle point</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>Answer: a lever</p></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>Example</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>Which machine raises a flag?</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>rope over a wheel</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>Answer: a pulley</p></div><h2>Common mistakes</h2><ul><li>Thinking simple machines need electricity.</li><li>Thinking a ramp makes the load lighter (it makes it easier to move).</li></ul>",
